FINAL EXPERIENCE

The School Chronicles must have a huge, detailed, beautifully designed academy with believable architecture, complete interiors, realistic furniture, functional doors, connected rooms and a large surrounding world.

The player should be able to approach almost any meaningful object and interact through a small contextual button.

The library should allow actual book selection and reading. Classrooms should allow sitting and studying. Cafeterias should allow ordering and eating. Computers should be usable. Doors should open. Furniture should work.

NPCs must use the same world intelligently and independently.

The objective is to create a genuinely interactive living 3D world, not a decorative 3D environment.